### Phase 1: Core Library (`frai-core/src/eval/`)

#### 1.1 `index.js` - generateReport() signature change
- Add optional `thresholds` parameter: `{ exact_match: 0.9, toxicity: 0.8, ... }`
- Compute `passed` boolean by checking each threshold:
  - Threshold passes if: metric exists AND metric.score !== null AND metric.score >= min
  - Any null score = threshold fails
- Add to report output:
  - `passed: boolean` (top level)
  - `thresholds: [ { metric, min, score, passed }, ... ]` (array, one per threshold)

#### 1.2 `reporters.js` - Output formatting
